Role in ATOMS OS:
  Provides hardware register offsets, bitfield definitions, and standard HDA
  verbs for Intel High Definition Audio controllers and compliant codecs.
  This component is third-party open-source technology integrated into ATOMS OS.
  It is not an original BOS engine.
